# Dependencies / build artifacts
**/node_modules
**/.venv
**/dist
**/__pycache__
**/*.pyc
**/.cache

# VCS / tooling / agent config
.git
.github
.claude

# Secrets — ignore real env files but keep the example checked in
**/.env
!**/.env.example

# Note: frontend/, backend/, skills/, data/ are intentionally NOT excluded —
# they are required in the build context. Markdown files are kept as well.
